# Line endings are part of the evidence model here, not a formatting detail.
#
# Several tests hash the BYTES of committed artifacts — geometry files, proof
# records, knowledge packs — to prove they have not changed. Without this file
# those bytes depend on the checkout platform: a Windows clone with
# core.autocrlf=true materialises CRLF while Linux CI materialises LF, so the
# same commit hashes two different ways and a byte-comparison test can only
# ever pass on one of them.
#
# Normalising to LF in the working tree makes those digests a property of the
# commit rather than of the machine that checked it out.

* text=auto eol=lf

# Evidence artifacts and binaries: never transformed, never diffed as text.
*.pdf binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.zip binary
*.warc binary
*.warc.gz binary
